    "title": "Metrolink to celebrate transit equity day with free rides in honor of Rosa Parks' birthday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By SPECIAL TO THE HERALD NEWS ,\n12 hours ago Metrolink, the region’s six-county passenger rail provider, will once again offer free rides on Transit Equity Day, observed annually on Feb. 4 in honor of civil rights pioneer Rosa Parks. Next Wednesday, riders may board without a ticket at any of Metrolink’s 67 stations and travel systemwide, including on the Arrow service. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
